      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just realized I cant even cahnge it to 2 split. Even that would help a lot. my shadow count average is 672 with 4 split, 603 with 2 slpit and only 505 with none! Thats 167 average wasted shadow casters.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
