  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-07-05T02:19:18.636Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I am currently working on a world that uses custom shaders to fall back to baked lighting for shadows. Because of this setup, I don't need shadow cascades.\n\nHowever, I realized there is currently no way to completely disable split cascades in VRChat. Being forced to use them, near doubles the shadow caster cost, eating into the performance budget for absolutely no visual benefit in cases like this.\n\nPlease add the ability to use no split cascades to give better control over performance optimization.",
